        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú mibaá nee tsiyáhh iimír waawutmo Hesekia iwa waawuti'ín, waawutmo Senakeribu oo Ashuru gixsadu sleémeero awa yaamaá Yuda, kudá' koo/i gawden gina i haratláy, giri hayóh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmoó Ashuru geeraharusmoó úr oo slaqwaruuseerós guri ya/aáw amór Lakishír wa alé, amór waawutmo Hesekia baraá gixsár Yerusalemu. Geeraharusmoodá' ina sihhiít dír maparír ma'aá wa/amis baraá tlahhsa, bihhaá gawa awa loohír ur ar dír hhuntsitór kaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri al'áy nee Eliakimu garmoó Hilkia kuduú sagesihhtusmoó doó waawutmo, nee Shebna kuduú goousmo, nee Yoa garmoó Asafu kuduú goousmoó muruú inslaslángw wa hariím. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharusmooduú slaqwaruuse iri oó', «Tlawsé', waawutmoohúng ku beera', waawutmoodá' úr oo Ashuru i kaahi, ‹Gár ta ak ló'wa harahhif a milá masa tawo migís? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kawa xu' axweesanoó tawo i /uuruú húwi nee sagalooa baraá slaqwaraaro? Heesíng ta harahhif a heemá tam aníng iri áhh? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ga/aaweek, kuúng múk Misri una harahhíf, inooín a adór daaír aa qet, hee birnga i tliintií' gun dawa /ák, an adór Farao i dirii'i dír mukdá' gwa harahhifi.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala kuúng bar kat, ‹Atén AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén un harahhifaán.› Xaysé' Munguúdá' Hesekia aa kiteeraá ilahhooa feé/ nee wa/aamér gawa aa feé/ an kwisingekáhe? Múk Yuda nee oo Yerusalemuwo guri báy, ‹Dír kitaangwí wák na wa sluufmisaak?› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimsé' qwalaas al'axweesantá wayda tleehhaak nee aakooeé', waawutmoó Ashuru. Daqaní aníng farsuú kumér tsár ngu haniís kuungá' bar múk gu i tsa/ám u sleera'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' sagadiyusmoó niiná baraá sagadiyuusér aakooeene adór ngura ki/isé' bar kuungá' aqo alee/isoó Misri un daamarandá' nee mukdá' faras ngwa i tsa/ani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe kuungá' kawa xua' aníng ninaqo tawó daqáwi, dákw Mungú iri kaahh dir'eene oo yaamuuká' ngiwa hhaamiis? Xuaak AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aníng ina báy, «Tláw yaamusingá' i haratlaweek ki hhaamís.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Eliakimu nee Shebna nee Yoa geeraharusmoodá' nguri bayé', «Na'ás, axweés ar tsifrír Aramu, asma atén a axamiisaán, ma axwesaar ar tsifrír Ebrania, asma múk gawaá koo/ír wa xumiís i axamiis.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala geeraharusmoodá' giri mu/aywaáts iri oó', «Ahaá aníng amór aakooeé' i ya/aáw a amór aakoohúng nee kuungá' kiloohúnge? Ahaá, a amór mukwí gawaá koo/ír wá sihhmiitaakáhe? Asma inooínaá kilá' aqo adór kuungá', alaá deelór niinawe /oo/oduuíná kilá' ngin /ayiyá' nee sooxaaín, ngiri wahaná', kiri hhaamiis.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharusmoodá' iri sihhiít, iri tseé' ar afór ur ar tsifrír Ebrania iri oó', «Axweesanoó waawutmo úr, waawutmoó Ashuru iiárií qaasaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo i kaahi, Hesekia mu aleeya/aa/amaara' nuwa al/agin. Asma inós kuungá' tu/uto nu aleeslayká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekia mu ale ya/a/amaará' nuwa harahhiifórí qamiín ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuwa harahhifa', iwa kaahi, ‹AAKOÓ MUNGÚ atén ti ba/amis looeemaawo, gixsarí ka hayohiiká nee waawutmoó Ashuru.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Hesekia mu iiárií qamiimara'. Waawutmoó Ashuru i kaahi, ‹Wayda tleehhaak nee aníng, qwalaasé' amor'eé', daqaní umuú heewo sabiíbu qaymoorós gu /aay, nee seituúnirose, nee iri hhekiit baraá hhalaangós oo kilá', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ay dír aníng nay hardah nuri huúw ay baraá yaamaá adór koohúng kuká'. Yaamaá balaangw iwa hamdiiti nee difaáiro, yaamaá angaáno nee qamaá sabiíbu kiwa sleera'.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magaahhé', Hesekia kuungá' munduwa hhaáf, iwa kaahi, ‹AAKOÓ MUNGÚ atén ti ba/amis.› Xaysé' baraá munguidaá xoorduuwo, Mungú mukós ngwaa tuu/ dír waawutmoó Ashururo i deéro? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, munguaá Hamati i amaáriya' nee awa Arpadiro? Xaysé', munguidaá Sefarfaimu i amoomá? Gaálaay Samaria ngaa tu/iye' gawaá dabaaeene? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá munguiiká ayeemookae a gaalá oo yaamuuwós ga tuu/ gawaá dabaaeene as kahhó' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ sleeme gixsár Yerusalemu ngiwa tu/i?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala muu ina qartlamiít, oo axweesantadá' gaa tlaaxw i kaahh asma waawutmo gina hara'ayín ina oó', «Ló' ma /aymu tlaxwaara'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Eliakimu garmoó Hilkia nee goousmo Shebna nee Yoa garmoó Asafu kuduú muruú inslaslángw wa hariím gu gooiím tari amór waawutmo Hesekia káy, tlabaaín ngaa feehhamiisiyé' muruudá' sleémeero oo geeraharusmoodá' aa aaín nguri alki/iitiyé' dír waawutmo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
